  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4dzJ9yxX/Advanced-Netherite-Banner-V13.png\" alt=\"Banner\"></p><h1><strong>Advanced Netherite（Forge / NeoForge）</strong></h1><p>這是 <strong>Forge / NeoForge</strong> 版本，請點擊<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>前往 Fabric 版本！</p><h5><strong>從 Minecraft 1.20.4 開始，Advanced Netherite 也將支援 NeoForge！</strong></h5><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>📖 關於</strong></h3><p><strong>Advanced Netherite</strong> 是一款可配置、原版友好且開放原始碼的模組，為 Minecraft 加入了更多階層的地獄合金！\n此模組的目標是透過增加更多可達成的目標，來延伸原版 Minecraft 的遊戲體驗。</p><p>更多資訊請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite Wiki</a>！</p><p>感謝 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LizterZapZap\" rel=\"nofollow\">LizterZapZap</a> 製作全新的改良材質！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>✅ 特色</strong></h3><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MTd6yX4W/Advanced-Netherite-Features-V11.png\" alt=\"特色\"></a></p><ul>\n<li>4 種 <strong>全新</strong> 的地獄合金階層！</li>\n<li>每個新階層的地獄合金都包含一套工具、一套盔甲和方塊</li>\n<li>每個地獄合金階層都有其獨特的屬性（特殊盔甲效果、工具額外掉落物）</li>\n<li>支援附加元件和資料包</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>💎 地獄合金階層</strong></h3><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MT1VXszQ/Types-Of-Netherite-Banner-V2.png\" alt=\"階層\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>🔨 合成配方</strong></h3><p>模組的合成配方可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki/Crafting-Recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite Wiki</a> 找到，或者直接安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a> 即可查閱！</p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>🔖 熱門版本連結</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=26.1.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 26.1.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.11\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.6\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.18.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.17.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.16.5</a></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>ℹ 更多資訊</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>請將問題回報至 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 問題追蹤器</a>！</li>\n<li>我可以在我的 CurseForge 模組包中使用你的模組嗎？當然可以，完全沒問題！</li>\n<li>Advanced Netherite 也提供 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a> 版本。</li>\n<li>點擊<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>查看更多圖片！</li>\n<li>前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite Wiki</a> 獲取更多關於此模組所有內容的詳細資訊。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h3><strong>💬 加入我的 Discord 伺服器！</strong></h3><p><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/KP3BBatuw5\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我的 Discord 伺服器</a>，即可在有新更新、模組支援等消息時獲得通知！</em></p><p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p><h4><strong>⚠️ 免責聲明</strong></h4><p>本模組僅透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadvanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 GitHub 儲存庫</a> 發布。\n請勿重新發布此模組，<em>或</em>從其他任何下載來源下載此模組。</p><p>更多關於模組轉載的詳細資訊，以及如何保護自己免受其害，請參閱：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstopmodreposts.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">stopmodreposts.org</a>。</p>",
